{
 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 0.1,
   "end": 1.4,
   "text": "If you’re buying land,"
  },
  {
   "start": 1.38,
   "end": 3.16,
   "text": "please save these 10 tips before"
  },
  {
   "start": 3.14,
   "end": 5.16,
   "text": "you pay even a token amount."
  },
  {
   "start": 5.14,
   "end": 7.24,
   "text": "One—verify the owner."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.22,
   "end": 8.84,
   "text": "Check the seller’s identity and"
  },
  {
   "start": 8.82,
   "end": 10.44,
   "text": "have a property lawyer examine"
  },
  {
   "start": 10.42,
   "end": 11.8,
   "text": "previous sale deeds and the"
  },
  {
   "start": 11.78,
   "end": 12.84,
   "text": "ownership chain."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.82,
   "end": 15.08,
   "text": "Two—check the land records."
  },
  {
   "start": 15.06,
   "end": 16.6,
   "text": "Verify the revenue records and"
  },
  {
   "start": 16.58,
   "end": 17.72,
   "text": "mutation entries—"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.7,
   "end": 19.24,
   "text": "the updates recording changes in"
  },
  {
   "start": 19.22,
   "end": 20.2,
   "text": "ownership."
  },
  {
   "start": 20.18,
   "end": 22.44,
   "text": "Don’t rely only on screenshots."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.42,
   "end": 24.92,
   "text": "Three—confirm the right to sell."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.9,
   "end": 26.28,
   "text": "Check for co-owners,"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.26,
   "end": 28.84,
   "text": "legal heirs and transfer restrictions."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.82,
   "end": 30.6,
   "text": "Can this seller legally sell the"
  },
  {
   "start": 30.58,
   "end": 31.88,
   "text": "entire property?"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.86,
   "end": 34.44,
   "text": "Four—check loans and disputes."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.42,
   "end": 35.96,
   "text": "Is the land mortgaged?"
  },
  {
   "start": 35.94,
   "end": 37.32,
   "text": "Is there a court case,"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.3,
   "end": 38.92,
   "text": "stay order or an existing"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.9,
   "end": 39.96,
   "text": "agreement to sell?"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.94,
   "end": 42.36,
   "text": "Five—verify the permitted use."
  },
  {
   "start": 42.34,
   "end": 43.72,
   "text": "Whether you’re planning a home,"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.7,
   "end": 45.32,
   "text": "warehouse or resort,"
  },
  {
   "start": 45.3,
   "end": 46.76,
   "text": "check the land-use permissions"
  },
  {
   "start": 46.74,
   "end": 48.92,
   "text": "and required conversion approvals."
  },
  {
   "start": 48.9,
   "end": 51.56,
   "text": "Six—verify approvals directly."
  },
  {
   "start": 51.54,
   "end": 53.32,
   "text": "‘JDA approved’ is a claim you"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.3,
   "end": 53.96,
   "text": "should check."
  },
  {
   "start": 53.94,
   "end": 55.56,
   "text": "Verify the patta and approved"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.54,
   "end": 56.92,
   "text": "layout with the Jaipur"
  },
  {
   "start": 56.9,
   "end": 58.12,
   "text": "Development Authority or the"
  },
  {
   "start": 58.1,
   "end": 59.96,
   "text": "relevant local authority."
  },
  {
   "start": 59.94,
   "end": 61.88,
   "text": "Seven—measure the actual land."
  },
  {
   "start": 61.86,
   "end": 63.24,
   "text": "Get the boundaries and area"
  },
  {
   "start": 63.22,
   "end": 64.6,
   "text": "surveyed, match them with the"
  },
  {
   "start": 64.58,
   "end": 66.12,
   "text": "records, and confirm who"
  },
  {
   "start": 66.1,
   "end": 67.96,
   "text": "physically possesses the property."
  },
  {
   "start": 67.94,
   "end": 70.36,
   "text": "Eight—check legal access."
  },
  {
   "start": 70.34,
   "end": 71.88,
   "text": "A road reaching the plot doesn’t"
  },
  {
   "start": 71.86,
   "end": 73.08,
   "text": "automatically mean you have a"
  },
  {
   "start": 73.06,
   "end": 74.36,
   "text": "legal right to use it."
  },
  {
   "start": 74.34,
   "end": 76.84,
   "text": "Verify access rights and road width."
  },
  {
   "start": 76.82,
   "end": 78.52,
   "text": "Nine—check restrictions and"
  },
  {
   "start": 78.5,
   "end": 79.74,
   "text": "site risks."
  },
  {
   "start": 79.72,
   "end": 81.08,
   "text": "Look for proposed roads,"
  },
  {
   "start": 81.06,
   "end": 82.36,
   "text": "acquisition notices,"
  },
  {
   "start": 82.34,
   "end": 83.48,
   "text": "drainage channels,"
  },
  {
   "start": 83.46,
   "end": 85.72,
   "text": "flood risks, forest restrictions"
  },
  {
   "start": 85.7,
   "end": 87.56,
   "text": "and high-voltage power lines."
  },
  {
   "start": 87.54,
   "end": 89.88,
   "text": "Ten—calculate the full cost and"
  },
  {
   "start": 89.86,
   "end": 91.24,
   "text": "document the deal."
  },
  {
   "start": 91.22,
   "end": 92.68,
   "text": "Include stamp duty,"
  },
  {
   "start": 92.66,
   "end": 94.68,
   "text": "registration, brokerage,"
  },
  {
   "start": 94.66,
   "end": 95.96,
   "text": "development costs and"
  },
  {
   "start": 95.94,
   "end": 97.24,
   "text": "outstanding dues."
  },
  {
   "start": 97.22,
   "end": 98.6,
   "text": "Before paying a token,"
  },
  {
   "start": 98.58,
   "end": 99.96,
   "text": "put verification,"
  },
  {
   "start": 99.94,
   "end": 102.2,
   "text": "refund and possession terms in writing."
  },
  {
   "start": 102.18,
   "end": 103.88,
   "text": "A good land purchase is one you"
  },
  {
   "start": 103.86,
   "end": 105.08,
   "text": "can legally own,"
  },
  {
   "start": 105.06,
   "end": 106.67,
   "text": "use and eventually sell."
  }
 ],
